{
    "title": "Handshake Jobs & New Careers",
    "description": "Handshake is the all-in-one career network for students to get ahead and get hired. Find jobs, connect with recruiters, and make career moves with the Handshake feed\u2014a distraction-free career destination for support, info, inspo, and guidance. Get noticed by your favorite companies and share real talk about jobs and careers with other students and new grads.\r\n\r\n\u25feInspiring career content\r\nGet career inspiration with posts, videos, images, and articles on success stories, career paths, and opportunities you never knew about. Dig deeper for inside intel on the topics that matter to you and comments that keep the conversation going.\r\n\r\n\u25feNever miss an event or opportunity\r\nStay on top of application deadlines, interviews, and events with timely reminders.\r\n\r\n\u25fePersonalized job recs\r\nGet recommendations for relevant jobs, opportunities, and events based on your profile, interests, and what\u2019s best for you.\r\n\r\n\u25feGuidance from sources you trust\r\nEasily find jobs and events and take the next step in your search with career center resources and programming, curated employers, events, fairs, articles, and appointments.\r\n\r\n\u25feSearch, save, and apply for the jobs you want\r\nStay organized and save time with opportunities based on your profile and interests, sorted by relevance.\r\n\r\n\u25feStand out in the search\r\nBe uniquely you with an enhanced, custom profile that goes beyond the standard resume. Explore options to add a quick summary and a header image.\r\n\r\n\u25feMessage with recruiters, students, and alumni\r\nGet the upper hand in interviews, answer your career questions, and make connections by messaging with interested recruiters, young professionals, and other students and new grads.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Handshake is the all-in-one career network for students to get ahead and get hired. Find jobs, connect with recruiters, and make career moves with the Handshake feed\u2014a distraction-free career destination for support, info, inspo, and guidance. Get noticed by your favorite companies and share real talk about jobs and careers with other students and new grads.<br><br>\u25feInspiring career content<br>Get career inspiration with posts, videos, images, and articles on success stories, career paths, and opportunities you never knew about. Dig deeper for inside intel on the topics that matter to you and comments that keep the conversation going.<br><br>\u25feNever miss an event or opportunity<br>Stay on top of application deadlines, interviews, and events with timely reminders.<br><br>\u25fePersonalized job recs<br>Get recommendations for relevant jobs, opportunities, and events based on your profile, interests, and what\u2019s best for you.<br><br>\u25feGuidance from sources you trust<br>Easily find jobs and events and take the next step in your search with career center resources and programming, curated employers, events, fairs, articles, and appointments.<br><br>\u25feSearch, save, and apply for the jobs you want<br>Stay organized and save time with opportunities based on your profile and interests, sorted by relevance.<br><br>\u25feStand out in the search<br>Be uniquely you with an enhanced, custom profile that goes beyond the standard resume. Explore options to add a quick summary and a header image.<br><br>\u25feMessage with recruiters, students, and alumni<br>Get the upper hand in interviews, answer your career questions, and make connections by messaging with interested recruiters, young professionals, and other students and new grads.",
